        "### Threshold Optimization: Experiment 2 model\n",
        "We will now sweep through probability thresholds to find the optimal balance between Precision and Recall for the production environment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
